        {
          "id": 450415921,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "That remaining warning is because there really is overlap in the h263 dissector between `h263.stream` and the Picture, GOB or Macro block start code bits that are also added as separate bit items. Not much to do about that without changing the dissector.",
